  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "8231828",
      "title": "Module Introduction & Starting Project",
      "sourceHash": "abf6fcf5b9b0ebf5afae5fdecedda3e79cc8eff0e42b5e7d72f02cfb45dd7663",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.63,
          "end": 2.97,
          "en": "In this course section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.97,
          "end": 7.02,
          "en": "we'll work on this Placepicker application here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.02,
          "end": 9.851,
          "en": "which allows us to pick places",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.851,
          "end": 12.75,
          "en": "we eventually might wanna visit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.75,
          "end": 15.33,
          "en": "And it also allows us to get rid of places",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.33,
          "end": 17.823,
          "en": "if we decide we don't want to go there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.9,
          "end": 21.99,
          "en": "And whilst working on this application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.99,
          "end": 24.6,
          "en": "and whilst enhancing this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.6,
          "end": 26.7,
          "en": "throughout this section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.7,
          "end": 31.44,
          "en": "we are going to dive into a super important React concept.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.44,
          "end": 34.56,
          "en": "Because in this section, you will learn how to deal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.56,
          "end": 38.25,
          "en": "with side effects in React apps,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.25,
          "end": 41.61,
          "en": "and you'll learn what exactly side effects are",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.61,
          "end": 44.16,
          "en": "and how you can manage them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.16,
          "end": 48.6,
          "en": "And for that you will learn how to tackle side effects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.6,
          "end": 51.3,
          "en": "and why in certain situations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.3,
          "end": 55.32,
          "en": "React's useEffect hook might be a good choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.32,
          "end": 58.71,
          "en": "You will of course learn how to use that hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.71,
          "end": 63.71,
          "en": "how to manage its dependencies, and what exactly that is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.72,
          "end": 68.133,
          "en": "And you will also learn when not to use useEffect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.06,
          "end": 71.16,
          "en": "But of course at this point,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.16,
          "end": 76.16,
          "en": "this all probably sounds rather confusing and abstract.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.56,
          "end": 78.93,
          "en": "And therefore let's dive right in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.93,
          "end": 80.97,
          "en": "Let me show you a side effect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.97,
          "end": 85.28999999999999,
          "en": "and why in certain use cases you need that useEffect hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.28999999999999,
          "end": 87.96000000000001,
          "en": "And of course also how you use it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 87.96000000000001,
          "end": 91.83,
          "en": "Now for this section, I prepared this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 91.83,
          "end": 95.58,
          "en": "here for you, and this starting project actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 95.58,
          "end": 98.75999999999999,
          "en": "already works quite well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.75999999999999,
          "end": 102.06,
          "en": "You can view places, you can select places,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.06,
          "end": 104.259,
          "en": "and you can delete places.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.259,
          "end": 108.45,
          "en": "Nonetheless, we're going to enhance this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.45,
          "end": 113.03999999999999,
          "en": "throughout this section and also add more features to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 113.03999999999999,
          "end": 115.97999999999999,
          "en": "And therefore, as always basically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 115.97999999999999,
          "end": 119.4,
          "en": "attached you'll find this starting project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 119.4,
          "end": 123.27,
          "en": "both a local and a code sandbox version.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 123.27,
          "end": 124.8,
          "en": "For the local version,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.8,
          "end": 128.22,
          "en": "as always, you should run npm install",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 128.22,
          "end": 131.76,
          "en": "and then npm run dev for the code sandbox version.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 131.76,
          "end": 134.01,
          "en": "This is not required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 134.01,
          "end": 136.86,
          "en": "Now if you take a look at this project code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.86,
          "end": 140.4,
          "en": "you'll notice that it has a couple of components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 140.4,
          "end": 143.28,
          "en": "which are relatively straightforward.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.28,
          "end": 146.61,
          "en": "They use features you already learned about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 146.61,
          "end": 149.67000000000002,
          "en": "like state and refs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 149.67000000000002,
          "end": 154.41,
          "en": "and the modal component uses useImperativeHandle here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 154.41,
          "end": 158.97,
          "en": "to expose some functions through a ref.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 158.97,
          "end": 163.97,
          "en": "And that ref here is received and extracted as a prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 164.52,
          "end": 167.67000000000002,
          "en": "Alternatively, this component could also be set up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 167.67000000000002,
          "end": 169.8,
          "en": "with help of forwardRef,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 169.8,
          "end": 172.77,
          "en": "but since this project uses a React version",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 172.77,
          "end": 175.02,
          "en": "high enough to not need that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 175.02,
          "end": 178.743,
          "en": "this component indeed is created without forwardRef.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 179.57999999999998,
          "end": 182.46,
          "en": "So these therefore, in the end, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 182.46,
          "end": 185.46,
          "en": "are all features you already learned about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 185.46,
          "end": 187.14,
          "en": "earlier in the course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 187.14,
          "end": 190.65,
          "en": "And overall, this application code should be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 190.65,
          "end": 194.61,
          "en": "relatively straightforward and nothing new.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 194.61,
          "end": 198,
          "en": "In the end, it's just about managing this array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 198,
          "end": 200.61,
          "en": "of picked places here by adding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 200.61,
          "end": 204.513,
          "en": "or removing places depending on where the user clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 205.65,
          "end": 209.16,
          "en": "But you'll also notice that this starting project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 209.16,
          "end": 211.668,
          "en": "also comes with a data.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 211.668,
          "end": 216.24,
          "en": "which includes a bunch of dummy data responsible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 216.24,
          "end": 220.413,
          "en": "for outputting these place cards here in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 221.4,
          "end": 223.731,
          "en": "And a loc.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 223.731,
          "end": 228.24,
          "en": "which contains some location calculation logic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 228.24,
          "end": 231.51,
          "en": "which we'll need throughout this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 231.51,
          "end": 236.19,
          "en": "And it's indeed this file, or specifically this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 236.19,
          "end": 238.62,
          "en": "which we'll need in the next lecture",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 238.62,
          "end": 242.223,
          "en": "where we will also meet our first side effect.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
